{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Fast,_quick,_and_learn_more_about_Algebraic_Manipulations!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Fast, quick, and learn more about Algebraic Manipulations!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/692e3bee67c91837acbdcf63862b3b3c94366f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are positive numbers satisfying\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45acc3f1463f663f3fa0b99ee25e08a65517ac7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + \\frac{1}{y} = 4,\\qquad y + \\frac{1}{z} = 1, \\qquad \\text{and} \\qquad z + \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{7}{3}\\]\" width=\"381\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Then what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/7/d57d8fef9329fabd73078ae824a034e8a00e332f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"28\" height=\"11\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/4/794cbd6b3e5c2a957205ca216ee33408efab9030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)}\\ \\frac{2}{3} \\qquad \\text {(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text {(C)}\\ \\frac{4}{3} \\qquad \\text {(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text {(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"341\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying all three equations yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/3/7e3bab56648695a4d5cbfe599d537f2adf42fe10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xyz + x + y + z + \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{z} + \\frac{1}{xyz} = \\frac{28}{3} \\text{ (i)}\\]\" width=\"356\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Adding all three equations yields: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fdf005f6125e55be362aded9dc970d1f2b5f72d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + y + z + \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{z} = \\frac{22}{3} \\text{ (ii)}\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting (ii) into (i) yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce05ca5b6009e2adbd2aebe44433a9384e32d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz + \\frac{22}{3} + \\frac{1}{xyz} = \\frac{28}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"177\" height=\"42\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a1381988d129ea707a083dedc47fdf2c262ad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz + \\frac{1}{xyz} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"117\" height=\"40\" />.  Solving yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a94d552c641953d017c9b1c9f62647cdeb8a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~AopsUser101, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have a system of three equations and three variables, so we can apply repeated substitution. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0d43b0925f112e173739d093abd90c9a6ecf41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4 = x + \\frac{1}{y} = x + \\frac{1}{1 - \\frac{1}{z}} = x + \\frac{1}{1-\\frac{1}{7/3-1/x}} = x + \\frac{7x-3}{4x-3}\\]\" width=\"439\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying out the denominator and simplification yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53d811901759a083ef6e0dbb99d8325796143f31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(4x-3) = x(4x-3) + 7x - 3 \\Longrightarrow (2x-3)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"391\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003bcebc12d2d3dd5107627be5b8f237dff6c147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. Substituting leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155bfd11da45fe153299de1b2d44d4bc500e52e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{2}{5}, z = \\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"100\" height=\"37\" />, and the product of these three variables is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZiJ29GzhyUY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZiJ29GzhyUY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Fast.2C_quick.2C_and_learn_more_about_Algebraic_Manipulations.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Fast,_quick,_and_learn_more_about_Algebraic_Manipulations!)\">Video Solution(Fast, quick, and learn more about Algebraic Manipulations!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Fast, quick, and learn more about Algebraic Manipulations!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rP8_-36n1ps\">https://youtu.be/rP8_-36n1ps</a> \n~MK\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SpSuqWY01SE&amp;t=374s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SpSuqWY01SE&amp;t=374s</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ph8o017pw_o\">https://youtu.be/ph8o017pw_o</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"